:COPYR.(C) Copyright Quartz Systems 2026.
:HELP NAME=ENDHOSTSVR.End Host Server (ENDHOSTSVR)
:P.Use the End Host Server (ENDHOSTSVR) command to end the host server
daemons.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='ENDHOSTSVR/SERVER'.Server type (SERVER)
:P.The server type for this command.
:P.A value is required.
:P.Up to 9 values can be given.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK.*ALL:EPK.
:PD.All of them.
:PT.:PK.*FILE:EPK.
:PD.The value of the file.
:EPARML.
:P.Also accepted&colon. *CENTRAL, *DATABASE, *DTAQ, *NETPRT, *RMTCMD,
*SIGNON, *SVRMAP.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='ENDHOSTSVR/ENDACTCNN'.End active connections (ENDACTCNN)
:P.The end active connections for this command.
:P.Up to 2 values can be given.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*NONE:EPK.
:PD.None.
:PT.:PK.*FILE:EPK.
:PD.The value of the file.
:EPARML.
:P.Also accepted&colon. *DATABASE.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=STRHOSTSVR.Start Host Server (STRHOSTSVR)
:P.Use the Start Host Server (STRHOSTSVR) command to start the host
server daemons (and the prestart jobs come with their subsystems).
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='STRHOSTSVR/SERVER'.Server type (SERVER)
:P.The server type for this command.
:P.A value is required.
:P.Up to 9 values can be given.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK.*ALL:EPK.
:PD.All of them.
:PT.:PK.*FILE:EPK.
:PD.The value of the file.
:EPARML.
:P.Also accepted&colon. *CENTRAL, *DATABASE, *DTAQ, *NETPRT, *RMTCMD,
*SIGNON, *SVRMAP.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='STRHOSTSVR/RQDPCL'.Required protocol (RQDPCL)
:P.The required protocol for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*ANY:EPK.
:PD.Any value matches.
:PT.:PK.*TCP:EPK.
:PD.TCP.
:PT.:PK.*NONE:EPK.
:PD.None.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
